{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BnLNQe4YoqBGQcZNT-7XiQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:44.019413+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BnLNQe4YoqBGQcZNT-7XiQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ZYtz1MsSQ4RTbytdiaPzIMoicwianRB9t8ZUZic1pDp0mgvl6Ems385uIZmXaibj9Gxxhy9NIv8kRs8DX275yboRQ0g/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span><span>清华建环</span></span></span><span><span> </span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>夏令营</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>活动信息：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动时间：</span></strong><span>2025年6月22日</span></p><p><strong><span>活动地点：</span></strong><span>清华大学旧土木馆</span></p><p><strong><span>活动内容：</span></strong><span>院系基本情况介绍、专题讲座、实验室参观、师生交流</span></p><p><strong><span>截止时间：</span></strong><span>请于2025年5月30日17:00前完成报名，逾期不再受理。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>本次活动为宣讲交流活动，欢迎同学们报名参加！</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）对建环专业感兴趣的全国高校本科三年级在校生（2026届本科毕业生），专业背景不限。</span></p><p><span>（2）本科学习成绩优异，前5个学期总评成绩在年级名列前茅；</span></p><p><span>（3）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）英语水平优良；</span></p><p><span>（5）身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（1）网上报名：</span>请登录</span></p><p><span> </span><span>https://www.wjx.top/vm/hHFyyYb.aspx#  完成填写；</span></p><p><span><span>（2）申请材料：</span>请申请者按照以下文件顺序合成一个PDF文件，文件以“姓名-本科学校-本科专业”命名，上传至网盘，网盘链接如下：</span><span>https://cloud.tsinghua.edu.cn/u/d/b1ca20385792440aa07f/</span></p><p><span>a）申请表（下载<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BnLNQe4YoqBGQcZNT-7XiQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">建环专业夏令营申请表</a>）；</span><span><br/></span><span>b）身份证复印件（含正反面）；</span></p><p><span>c）在读证明（学生证扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>d）两位副教授（含）以上职称专家推荐信；</span></p><p><span>e）本科阶段成绩证明，需提供成绩排名（需盖学校或院系教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>f）外语水平证明（提交扫描件）；</span><span><br/></span><span>g）其他申请材料（如有，请提供）：</span></p><p><span>科研能力证明（包含成果与获奖）：</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>成果：包括论文和专利等的相关证明材料（论文需提供刊物封面、目录页、文章首页，专利需提供证书）。</span></p><p><span>获奖：科研获奖、学科竞赛、参与课题等相关证明材料。</span></p><p><span>其它校级以上奖励荣誉，或参加实践活动（学生工作、社团活动、志愿服务等）或实际工作表现等方面的证明材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>提醒：(1)网上报名和(2)申请材料均于</span></span><span><span>2025年5月30日17:00前完成提交，视为报名成功。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>材料审核：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>报名材料审核由清华建环专业夏令营专家组负责，参营名单预计于2025年6月8日通过邮件通知。未收到通知者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 如因不可抗力影响或上级部门出台新政策、安排或计划调整，导致夏令营工作安排或信息变化的，我专业将做相应调整，最终以我专业发布的相关通知为准，具体另行通知。</span></p><p><span>2. 本次夏令营不收取报名费用，交通和住宿自理，部分餐食由主办方安排。活动议程另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>李老师，邮箱：hvac@tsinghua.edu.cn</span><span><br/></span><span>（请以“夏令营咨询”为主题发送邮件）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0ESXqEJhAf0eo6XhjZR7wmL5M6y8xWwVpQF7wicnd4q3JZX60VJsicgNjR05x0E95oWXmQqBiajsj38g/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/lLSX9Rxl0onSdQqQrC0vSPftAkVTMic1mVWBicIgSu8qRhH8F3TmOOxNUz5FS5oiaXANtjPcXcfibI5R7lhX8CAibdQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/YuESbsmpxBasCLGKbvXvMtcqibMEzvBM5x3JShCjoodP4Bt2JCWaVYwbyf4kPhLJ8oRqwqWrjCQvnia8kgcPibQCw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span> </span><span><span>清华建环</span></span><span> </span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b4c49d06